<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Hello </span><font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University and our W. P. Carey School of Business. The business school has higher admission requirements than ASU's general admission requirements. Both the BA and the BS business degrees require a 3.00 cumulative transfer GPA. The BS degrees also require one of the following:</font></div><div><ol><li><span style="font-family: arial;">SAT score of 1230 or above for tests taken after March 2016 or 1160 or above for tests taken before March 2016 (math and reading sections only)</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">25 ACT score</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">unweighted high school GPA of 3.60 or higher (in 16 competency courses)</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">high school class rank in top 8% of graduating class</span></li></ol></div><div><font face="arial">You can view these <a href="https://wpcarey.asu.edu/undergraduate-degrees/transfer">admission requirements</a> online.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have not taken the SAT or ACT before, or need to retake one of these exams due to a low score, you can review the websites below for information on upcoming test dates, registration and study options.</font></div><div><font face="arial">SAT: <a href="https://www.collegeboard.org/">collegeboard.org</a></font></div><div><font face="arial">ACT: <a href="http://www.actstudent.org/">actstudent.org</a></font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You can also take the ACT through ASU's testing services. The ACT through ASU is called the ACT Residual, as the test score is only valid at ASU. The <a href="https://uoeee.asu.edu/exam/act-residual">ACT Residual exam</a> is offered several times a month and scores are available the same day.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Students who do not meet the requirements for direct admission into the W. P. Carey School of Business may <a href="https://wpcarey.asu.edu/undergraduate-degrees/admission-portfolio">submit an admission portfolio</a> to be considered for admission. This process is competitive and there is no guarantee of admission.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">For further questions on the admission requirements, you may contact the W. P. Carey School of Business admission office at <a href="mailto:wpcadmissions@asu.edu">wpcadmissions@asu.edu</a> or 480-965-4227.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Let me know if you have any further questions. I'm happy to help.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>